1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-dev-dispatch","id":"main","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux 開発者向け"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"ディスパッチと判断カード"}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"dev-nav","aria-label":"開発者向けページの中の移動","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"dev-nav-root","href":"/dev","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"開発者向け"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","/dev/boundary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/boundary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"境界"}]}],["$","li","/dev/editor",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/editor","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エディタ本体"}]}],["$","li","/dev/observation",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/observation","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"観測とカード"}]}],["$","li","/dev/dispatch",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/dispatch","aria-current":"page","children":"ディスパッチ"}]}],["$","li","/dev/resume",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/resume","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"resume"}]}],["$","li","/dev/house",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/house","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エージェントの家"}]}],["$","li","/dev/subsystems",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/subsystems","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"周辺の仕組み"}]}],["$","li","/dev/runtime",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/runtime","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"いま動いているもの"}]}],["$","li","/dev/plans",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/plans","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"設計文書と実装"}]}],["$","li","/dev/responsibility",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/responsibility","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"責務の分け方"}]}],["$","li","/dev/glossary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/glossary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"用語"}]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<div class=\"callout accent\"><p>委譲便とは、親が別のペインに新しいセッションを立てて仕事を出し、回収するまでの 1 回分です。これを組み立てているのはハーネスで、アプリは spawn、send、read、close の「器」を貸しているだけです。アプリは、便という概念を持っていません。</p><p>アプリ側にある「委譲の見守り」は、ハーネスの台帳を古い読み方で読んでいます。いまの便の形では、ほとんど通知が出ないと見ています（推測、通知の件数は未計測）。見張り（<code>dispatch_guard.py</code>）は、9 月中旬から意図的に止めてあります。判断カードは、9 月中旬以降の 22 枚がすべて子から出たもので、うち 21 枚が解決しました。</p></div>\n<p>このページでは、ディスパッチ（親から子への委譲）の仕組みを、ハーネス側とアプリ側に分けて説明します。親（作者と話している Claude のセッション）は、重い作業を子（親が別のペインに立てた新しいセッション）に出します。そうすると親の文脈（会話の履歴）が軽いまま保て、並列に回せます。</p><p>記録は、7 月末に始まった台帳（<code>ledger.jsonl</code>、便を 1 行ずつ残すファイル）にあり、調査時点で 453 便あります。8 月から 9 月にかけて、ハーネス側の読み方と見張りが何度か作り直されました。そのため、アプリ側の実装や文書との食い違いが残っています。</p><p>このページの目的は、いまどこが生きていて、どこが食い違っているかを 1 か所にまとめることです。ハーネス側のファイルは、session-dispatch skill の中の相対パス（<code>SKILL.md</code>、<code>scripts/…</code>）か、<code>~/.claude/</code> からのパスで書きます。</p>"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-layout","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"sections":[{"id":"map","title":"全体の地図"},{"id":"flow","title":"1 便の流れ"},{"id":"ledger","title":"台帳 ledger.jsonl"},{"id":"send","title":"追加指示の送信"},{"id":"collect","title":"完了の回収"},{"id":"ask-card","title":"判断カード"},{"id":"guard","title":"見張り dispatch_guard（休止中）"},{"id":"watchdog","title":"アプリ側: 委譲の見守り"},{"id":"workorder","title":"アプリ側: WorkOrder と自動化スイッチ"},{"id":"vessel","title":"器: spawn、send、close の約束"},{"id":"v-next","title":"凍結中の後継設計 v-next の 12 件はいま"},{"id":"words","title":"「ディスパッチ」が指す 9 つのもの"},{"id":"mismatches","title":"境界の食い違い"},{"id":"unverified","title":"未確認事項"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-article","children":[["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"このページの目次"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"このページの目次","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","map",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#map","children":"全体の地図"}]}],["$","li","flow",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#flow","children":"1 便の流れ"}]}],["$","li","ledger",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ledger","children":"台帳 ledger.jsonl"}]}],["$","li","send",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#send","children":"追加指示の送信"}]}],["$","li","collect",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#collect","children":"完了の回収"}]}],["$","li","ask-card",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ask-card","children":"判断カード"}]}],["$","li","guard",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#guard","children":"見張り dispatch_guard（休止中）"}]}],["$","li","watchdog",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#watchdog","children":"アプリ側: 委譲の見守り"}]}],["$","li","workorder",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#workorder","children":"アプリ側: WorkOrder と自動化スイッチ"}]}],["$","li","vessel",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#vessel","children":"器: spawn、send、close の約束"}]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"]}]}]]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]]}]]}]
